{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2022-07-29 11:20:00', 'title': 'GENERAL DYNAMICS ELECTRIC BOAT AWARDED $698 MILLION CONTRACT MODIFICATION FOR OVERHAUL OF USS HARTFORD', 'text': 'GROTON, CONN. , JULY 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GENERAL DYNAMICS ELECTRIC BOAT, A BUSINESS UNIT OF GENERAL DYNAMICS (NYSE: GD), ANNOUNCED TODAY IT WAS AWARDED A MODIFICATION OF THE PREVIOUSLY AWARDED U.S. NAVY CONTRACT FOR THE REPAIR, MAINTENANCE AND MODERNIZATION OF THE SUBMARINE USS HARTFORD (SSN 768).'}